[[0,1724988,0,5,0,5,"2017-03-16T21:19:26","anon251","",[],"","George Soros: When Hate Surges","https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/16/opinion/george-soros-when-hate-surges.html?_r=0","Identitarian"],[1,8440085,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-16T21:59:37","goat2017","",[],"<p>I thought it would be sort of interesting to see Mr. Soros' own perspective. I'm somewhat disappointed so much of it seems dishonest, although maybe I shouldn't be too surprised.</p>"],[1,8440713,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-16T22:53:23","con77","",[],"<p>servant of the anti christ</p>"],[1,8441686,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-17T00:41:01","Possible","",[],"<p>I thought they were deporting <em>illegal</em> immigrants... That's a pretty specific point of qualification.</p>\n<p>Like... if a neighborhood had a problem with animal remains and decided to clean up the dead animals, Soros would call this a neighborhood-wide genocide on all animals! and that your beautiful golden retriever, fluffy was being threatened by the new initiative.</p>\n<p>Now of course some moron will miss the point and claim I'm calling immigrants dead animals. Nonsense is always and everywhere the preferred means of opposing a sound argument.</p>"]]
[[0,1724989,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-16T21:20:36","SpectralForces","",[],"<p>Which makes sense given we come from the same planet. However if we visited another planet this could have dire implications.</p>","I'm fairly sure every plant is poisonous, we just have an immunity to most of them.","","Showerthoughts"],[1,8439683,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-16T21:25:57","acheron2012","",[],"<p>Or none of them are poisonous but we have an allergic reaction to some of them.</p>"],[1,8440118,0,2,0,2,"2017-03-16T22:01:56","Le_Squish","",[],"<p>Onions and garlic are a pretty cool demonstration of the idea. Humans can efficiently metabolize their toxins that sicken and kill other mammals.</p>"],[2,8440250,8440118,1,0,1,"2017-03-16T22:12:23","SpectralForces","",[],"<p>Chocolate is another example. Those cacao beans are deathly poisonous for a lot of animals. They can't process the theobromine at a high enough rate. </p>"]]
[[0,1724990,0,6,0,6,"2017-03-16T21:20:51","cumquats","",[],"<p>PB&amp;J is the only one I can think of.</p>","Is there a sandwich that pickles do not go with?","","AskVoat"],[1,8439678,0,4,0,4,"2017-03-16T21:25:43","SpectralForces","",[],"<p>All the ones I make. I can't stand pickles...actually I should be more precise-I can't stand vinegar. The smell alone makes me gag. As for the vinegarless pickles that are brined, they just don't taste very good to me. </p>"],[1,8439692,0,4,0,4,"2017-03-16T21:26:46","xenoPsychologist","",[],"<p>have you tried pb&amp;j with pickles?</p>"],[1,8439735,0,12,1,11,"2017-03-16T21:30:59","DillHoleBagHands","",[],"<p>Fuck pickles.</p>"],[2,8439853,8439735,8,0,8,"2017-03-16T21:39:27","Ina_Pickle","",[],"<p>Fuck you too.</p>"],[3,8439885,8439853,3,0,3,"2017-03-16T21:41:42","DillHoleBagHands","",[],"<p>Good!</p>"],[4,8439892,8439885,2,0,2,"2017-03-16T21:42:14","Ina_Pickle","",[],"<p>Well then!</p>"],[5,8439918,8439892,1,0,1,"2017-03-16T21:44:18","DillHoleBagHands","",[],"<p>Just how I like it! Offended, a dash of malice, and a butt-ton of contempt. Tasty!</p>"],[1,8439888,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-16T21:41:45","Ina_Pickle","[e]",[],"<p>You'd eat pickles on roast beef au jus? I guess you could, but it wouldn't be my first choice.</p>"],[1,8439900,0,8,0,8,"2017-03-16T21:42:33","Akas","",[],"<p>Ice cream sandwich, unless you're pregnant I guess.</p>"],[1,8439901,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-16T21:42:50","MetalAegis","",[],"<p>Cheese and jam sandwich. </p>"],[1,8440104,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-16T22:00:50","Karbuster","",[],"<p>Every sandwich, pickles are gross (and yes I've tried them recently)</p>"],[1,8440215,0,3,0,3,"2017-03-16T22:09:52","goatboy","",[],"<p>Fuck Sweet Pickles. Fuck Bread &amp; Butter pickles. Fuck Candied pickles. Fuck Sweet/Hot pickles. You can even go fuck Pickled Peppers. The only pickle that matters is dill pickle. Fuck all the pickle posers. I'm a proud Dill Pickle Supremacist! And Dill Pickles go great with everything- you kike nigger real pickle hating faggots.</p>"],[1,8440426,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-16T22:26:47","phw","",[],"<p>Yes: my sandwich.</p>"],[1,8440479,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-16T22:31:35","Gringojones","",[],"<p>Love pickles. But once I had a cheesesteak and they put sweet relish on it. It was terrible. </p>"],[1,8441147,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-16T23:41:50","vladpootin","",[],"<p>knuckle sandwich \r\nshit sandwich \r\nice cream sandwich \r\nyour mom and two black stud bulls\r\nPB&amp;J</p>"],[1,8441166,0,2,0,2,"2017-03-16T23:43:57","8_billion_eaters","",[],"<p>PB&amp;J. ............Pickles are great, but not with that.</p>"],[1,8441389,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-17T00:09:44","Mghorning","",[],"<p>What do you mean by; pickle?</p>"],[1,8441664,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-17T00:38:35","SocialJusticePanda","",[],"<p>Grilled cheese</p>"],[1,8442043,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-17T01:20:53","Goathammer","",[],"<p>A pickle sandwich, because that would be way too many pickles.</p>"],[1,8442049,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-17T01:21:42","oedipusaurus_rex","",[],"<p>cheeseburgers.</p>"],[1,8442678,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-17T02:24:27","Rellik88","",[],"<p>All of them</p>"],[1,8442805,0,0,0,0,"2017-03-17T02:37:07","hats_","",[],"<p>a hotdog.</p>\n<p>...I''ll show myself out.</p>"],[1,8444295,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-17T05:19:59","Inaminit","",[],"<p>A fried banana sandwich...</p>"]]
